    "en": "Canvas UI pushes the boundaries of browser rendering with GPU-accelerated liquid simulations, organic shader blobs, particle fields, and interactive physics canvases. Built for creative landing pages, it gives websites a hypnotic visual identity without sacrificing FPS.",
